{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Send invitations to unlock more customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After meeting the corresponding conditions, new customers can be invited to come. Can you fufill their demanding requirements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/cat_play.gif?t=1745151949\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set the food purchase plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully consider the daily purchase quantity of food, reduce unnecessary costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful and fun facilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase various facilities, decorate your own personalized inn, and bring more joy to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/buding.gif?t=1745151949\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Delightful and relaxing playing experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No event requires immediate actions, you can focus on other work without keeping an eye on the business situation, the staff will\u00a0make all things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/extras/hamster_staff.gif?t=1745151949\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480390?t=1745151949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745151949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/5e2b624fa07747193b4617e45b17dde759d594ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745151949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480390/5e2b624fa07747193b4617e45b17dde759d594ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745151949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievem